[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_II]
Muffins!

[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_II_desc]
Why so complicated? Come on, we are the Equestria Empire! Does the Empress need any reason to get rid of somepony?\nIf you are just worried about public opinion, just act in secret! The only thing we know is that Derpy likes muffins, but that’s also the only thing we need to know!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_II]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_MUFFIN_II_desc]
为什么要这么麻烦？拜托，我们可是小马利亚帝国诶！女皇想要除掉谁，难道还需要什么理由吗？\n如果只是担心公众的反应，只要秘密行动就好了！我们只知道呆蹄喜欢马芬，但这也足够了呀！

